      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I see, then I guess mystery is your favorite genre. What makes a mystery so captivating to you? Is it the thrill of uncovering secrets or the satisfaction of solving puzzles?",
